        <mxCell id="85a-331" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it:&lt;/b&gt; PK = primary key, FK = foreign key, grey = optional. || is the &quot;one&quot; side and the crow's foot the &quot;many&quot; side. Line colour shows the &quot;one&quot; table; light grey lines are business_id and light blue lines are user_id links. Main columns only; all columns are in the full ERD page of the draw.io file." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
